{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And He blessed, and He sanctified.</b> He blessed it with the manna — for all the days of the week an omer per head descended to them, and on the sixth a double portion; and He sanctified it with the manna — for it did not descend at all on Shabbat. And the verse is written concerning the future." "<b>Which Elohim created to do.</b> The work that was fit to be done on Shabbat, He doubled and did on the sixth, as is explained in Bereshit Rabbah."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:33.444602322Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}